    <data key="d0">Intellect Design Fabric Data Platform Architecture</data>
    <data key="d1" />
    <data key="d2">Architecture showing ingestion from multiple data sources through ELB to Kubernetes (K8S), buffered via Amazon MQ, stored in MongoDB Atlas over VPC Peering, alongside RDS and Redis management services.</data>
